I am thrilled to present my latest Computer Vision project: Face Mask Detection System! 😷

I built an end-to-end real-time Face Mask Detection web application using YOLOv8 and Streamlit as part of my hands-on training task at Instant Academy, under the mentorship of Eng. Mahmoud El-Moniawy.

✨ Key Highlights of the Project:
* 🎯 Model: Fine-tuned a YOLOv8 Nano model on a custom dataset from Roboflow to classify faces into mask (Green) and no-mask (Red).
* 📊 Performance: Achieved high precision and recall after training and evaluating on unseen test data.
* 💻 Web Application: Built an interactive web interface using Streamlit for seamless image upload and instant inference visualization.
* ☁️ Deployment: Fully deployed on Streamlit Community Cloud.

